# RULE (2026-09-18, Bear): renders stay out; source ASSETS may stay in.
#   OUT — anything the pipeline produced from a beat sheet: generated narration
#         (mp3/, audio/), beat clips (media/, clips/), Manim output, review
#         cuts, final masters, Topaz/8K variants, staged copies.
#   IN  — anything used to BUILD the video: browser/screen captures, source
#         recordings, sound effects and licensed cues (sfx/, assets/), pantry
#         stills and clips, fixtures. Keep each file under GitHub's 100 MB cap.
**/mp3/
**/audio/
**/media/
**/clips/
**/manim/
**/exports/
**/mp4/
**/renders/
**/_qc/
**/deck*.html
**/qc-sheet.png
*-slate.mp4
*-cut.mp4
*-review.mp4
*-topaz.mp4
*-8k.mp4
